#: src/strings.ts:2222
msgid ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**"
msgstr ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**Envio forçado:\n"
"Use isto se as alterações feitas neste dispositivo não aparecerem nos outros. Os dados no servidor serão substituídos pelos deste dispositivo.\n"
"\n"
"Recebimento forçado:\n"
"Use isto se as alterações de outros dispositivos não aparecerem neste. Os dados neste dispositivo serão substituídos pelos dados mais recentes do servidor.\n"
"\n"
"**Isto deve ser usado apenas para solucionar problemas. Não é recomendado usar regularmente para sincronizar, pois causará perda inesperada de dados e outros problemas. Se você tiver problemas persistentes de sincronização, comunique-nos em support@streetwriters.co.**"

